---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import ProjectCTA from '../components/ProjectCTA.astro';
import CaseTemplate from '../components/CaseTemplate.astro';
import CaseFilm from '../components/CaseFilm.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Colossus, Custom Webflow Development | Zion Creative" description="Website design by Colossus. Custom Webflow development by Nick VanMeter at Zion Creative, with expressive motion, responsive layouts and robust project filtering.">
<Header/><main id="main"><CaseTemplate name="Colossus" tagline="Big creative energy. Built for the web." related={['/wholemoon','/project/kp','/project/vpne']}>
<CaseFilm slot="hero" name="home-scroll" label="Full Colossus homepage scroll, recorded by Zion Creative"/>
<section class="container clean-story-section colossus-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Insight</p><div class="clean-story-copy"><h2>A creative voice that deserves a bigger stage.</h2><p>Colossus champions the business of creativity. Its website needed to bring the agency’s personality, people and varied body of work together in an experience that feels unmistakably Colossus.</p><p>The Colossus team designed that vision. Nick VanMeter at Zion Creative developed it as a custom Webflow website, carrying the design through to a working experience across desktop and mobile.</p></div><div class="clean-case-credits colossus-credits"><div><strong>Website design</strong>Colossus team</div><div><strong>Website development</strong>Nick VanMeter / Zion Creative</div><div><strong>Platform</strong>Webflow</div><a class="text-link credits-live-link" href="https://www.wearecolossus.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the live website <Arrow/></a></div></section>

<CaseFilm name="home-slider" label="Colossus interactive homepage project slider demonstration"/>
<section class="container clean-story-section"><p class="eyebrow">Exploration</p><div class="clean-story-copy"><h2>Filter your heart out.</h2><p>The project collection can be explored across 18 categories. Visitors can combine filters, see category counts, remove individual selections, or clear them all to start again. URL-based selections make filtered views shareable.</p><p>The interface makes a wide-ranging portfolio easier to navigate while keeping the agency’s distinctive visual language front and center.</p></div></section>
<div class="clean-media-pair"><figure><img src="/images/colossus-desktop-lifestyle-1280.webp" srcset="/images/colossus-desktop-lifestyle-640.webp 640w, /images/colossus-desktop-lifestyle-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Colossus project filtering interface on a desktop monitor in a warm, naturally lit creative studio" loading="lazy"/></figure><figure><img src="/images/colossus-mobile-lifestyle-1280.webp" srcset="/images/colossus-mobile-lifestyle-640.webp 640w, /images/colossus-mobile-lifestyle-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Colossus news article on a smartphone in a warm, minimal oak and cream workspace" loading="lazy"/></figure></div>
<section class="container clean-story-section"><p class="eyebrow">Across screens</p><div class="clean-story-copy"><h2>One personality. Every screen.</h2><p>The same creative voice carries from a spacious desktop canvas to a focused mobile experience. Project pages, editorial content and navigation adapt to the screen while retaining the detail and personality of the original design.</p></div></section>
<div class="clean-media-pair video-pair"><CaseFilm name="news-scroll" label="Colossus news experience and article layout demonstration"/><CaseFilm name="mobile-scroll" label="Colossus About page scroll on a mobile screen" portrait/></div>
<section class="clean-impact"><div class="container clean-impact-inner"><div class="clean-impact-facts" aria-label="Delivered website capabilities"><p><strong>18</strong>Project filtering categories</p><p><strong>Shareable</strong>Filtered portfolio views</p><p><strong>Responsive</strong>Desktop and mobile layouts</p><p><strong>Webflow</strong>Custom development and CMS</p></div><div class="clean-impact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Impact</p><h2>A distinct creative presence.<br/>Built to keep evolving.</h2><p>The finished website turns Colossus’s design into a connected digital experience: work that is easier to explore, editorial pages that give stories room to breathe, and responsive layouts that carry the agency’s personality across screens.</p><p>Custom Webflow development brings those pieces together in a platform the team can continue to build on.</p></div></div></section>
</CaseTemplate><ProjectCTA/></main><Footer/>
</BaseLayout>

<style>.colossus-intro{row-gap:30px}.colossus-credits{grid-column:2;align-items:center;margin-top:0;gap:20px 30px}.credits-live-link{margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap;font-size:14px}@media(max-width:760px){.colossus-credits{grid-column:1}.credits-live-link{margin-left:auto}}</style>
